{
    "background_story": "Ophelia was a mystic who delved deep into the ancient teachings of Zurvanism, a long-forgotten philosophy that emphasized the balance of time and the cosmos. She spent years studying the sacred texts and practicing the intricate rituals, seeking to understand the mysteries of the universe. As she progressed on her spiritual journey, Ophelia began to see the world through the lens of Zurvanism, perceiving the intricate web of causality that bound all things together. Her wisdom and insight earned her a reputation as a seer, and people would seek her counsel on matters of fate and destiny. Ophelia's home became a sanctuary for those seeking balance and harmony, where she would guide them through the complexities of time and the cosmos, helping them find their place within the grand tapestry of existence.",
